WEBVTT

00:03.336 --> 00:04.754
Here she comes, Reiner.

00:05.005 --> 00:05.964
Right.

00:25.775 --> 00:26.609
Oh, no...

00:27.527 --> 00:29.362
Eren's being taken away!

00:37.996 --> 00:40.957
All squads!
Let the Titans chase after you!

00:41.166 --> 00:42.792
Follow my lead!

00:44.085 --> 00:45.295
Erwin...

00:45.545 --> 00:46.796
You demon!

00:46.963 --> 00:49.674
Are you trying to use us as bait again?

00:50.175 --> 00:51.426
That's not my intention!

00:52.010 --> 00:53.720
The Military Police have fought well!

00:54.220 --> 00:56.181
Now serve your duty as soldiers!

00:57.223 --> 01:00.018
The Armored Titan plans to escape
with Eren!

01:00.518 --> 01:02.729
We have to stop him no matter what!

02:44.998 --> 02:47.417
He's not fast enough to escape!
We'll catch up!

02:48.251 --> 02:49.836
This time, I won't hesitate.

02:50.253 --> 02:52.046
I swear I'll kill them both!

02:52.839 --> 02:54.382
And if Ymir gets in my way,

02:54.632 --> 02:56.342
that means she's asking for it too.

02:57.385 --> 02:58.845
No matter what it takes...

02:59.637 --> 03:00.513
I will!

03:15.945 --> 03:16.779
Christa!

03:24.746 --> 03:25.705
Ymir...

03:33.796 --> 03:34.631
Ymir!

03:39.052 --> 03:39.886
Chris...

03:41.512 --> 03:42.430
No...

03:42.764 --> 03:43.681
Historia...

03:44.182 --> 03:45.183
Sorry...

03:45.600 --> 03:47.268
for eating you like that...

03:49.145 --> 03:51.439
I bet you're mad at me.

03:53.358 --> 03:54.192
Ymir...

03:55.276 --> 03:57.570
What is this? What are you doing?

03:58.112 --> 04:00.240
We came to rescue you and Eren--

04:00.365 --> 04:01.532
I don't need rescuing!

04:02.492 --> 04:04.077
Just stay right there.

04:04.786 --> 04:07.413
I'm following Reiner and Bertholdt now.

04:08.122 --> 04:10.041
You too. Come with me.

04:11.417 --> 04:13.753
There's no future within the walls!

04:17.465 --> 04:18.925
Listen to me, Historia...

04:20.468 --> 04:23.554
The world outside the walls
isn't as bad as you think.

04:24.264 --> 04:27.725
Because there, no one will say

04:28.017 --> 04:29.936
that you're better off not being born.

04:31.980 --> 04:34.691
I'm pretty sure Titans
won't say that to me

04:35.066 --> 04:37.277
because they'll be too busy
trying to eat me!

04:37.986 --> 04:41.072
Everyone has at least one or two faults!

04:41.322 --> 04:43.908
If you can just overlook that,
they're not so bad after all!

04:44.075 --> 04:46.619
Everything you're saying and doing

04:46.786 --> 04:48.788
doesn't make any sense, Ymir!

04:50.248 --> 04:51.499
Could it be that...

04:52.083 --> 04:54.419
Reiner and Bertholdt threatened you?

05:01.509 --> 05:03.261
It's the opposite...

05:04.595 --> 05:06.431
Am I right, Ymir?

05:06.931 --> 05:10.351
I'll fight them with you,
so let me out of your hand!

05:11.019 --> 05:13.396
I don't care if there's something
you can't tell me.

05:13.730 --> 05:14.981
No matter what happens...

05:15.398 --> 05:17.859
I will always be your ally!

05:25.283 --> 05:26.284
Ymir!

05:27.702 --> 05:28.536
Look...

05:29.329 --> 05:31.789
The Scouts have already gotten this close.

05:32.582 --> 05:34.208
If only we had run right away,

05:34.375 --> 05:36.794
we probably would've been able to escape.

05:37.420 --> 05:39.297
But because you forced us
to bring Christa,

05:39.797 --> 05:41.799
at this rate, they'll catch us!

05:43.760 --> 05:45.511
Hey, Ymir.

05:46.054 --> 05:49.098
Are you telling us
we did all of that for nothing?

05:49.599 --> 05:51.142
Did you change your mind?

05:52.060 --> 05:53.853
Is that really what you want?

05:54.145 --> 05:56.439
Letting Christa rot within the walls?

05:57.148 --> 05:58.983
Don't be stupid, Ymir!

05:59.609 --> 06:02.153
Hurry up and let me go, Ymir!

06:02.487 --> 06:03.321
I can't!

06:11.162 --> 06:12.163
Historia...

06:13.581 --> 06:14.791
To be honest...

06:15.500 --> 06:17.502
the reason I snatched you away...

06:19.087 --> 06:21.798
was only to save myself.

06:23.341 --> 06:24.217
What?

06:25.885 --> 06:27.136
A long time ago,

06:27.637 --> 06:30.640
I stole the Power of the Titans
from one of their comrades.

06:31.474 --> 06:33.267
There's nothing I can do against them.

06:33.810 --> 06:35.645
Sooner or later, they'll kill me.

06:36.604 --> 06:37.438
But...

06:37.730 --> 06:40.525
if I hand you over
and cooperate with them,

06:41.150 --> 06:43.361
they said they would try to make it

06:43.820 --> 06:45.780
so my crime goes away.

06:46.989 --> 06:48.783
Because you know the secrets of the wall,

06:49.075 --> 06:51.202
you're someone important to the Church.

06:53.329 --> 06:56.749
Does it have to do with my family?

06:57.291 --> 06:59.210
Yes, it does.

07:00.711 --> 07:03.172
Once this world started going to hell...

07:03.798 --> 07:04.799
I thought being with you

07:05.216 --> 07:07.844
would give me insurance in the future.

07:08.761 --> 07:11.848
I almost died during the battle
at that castle...

07:12.682 --> 07:14.392
and that feeling scarred me for life.

07:15.143 --> 07:16.394
I'm afraid to die...

07:17.103 --> 07:18.729
I'll do whatever it takes to live...

07:19.522 --> 07:20.731
I'm pathetic...

07:21.399 --> 07:23.985
I told myself
I was doing it for your sake...

07:24.777 --> 07:27.363
But really, I was doing it for myself.

07:30.241 --> 07:32.535
Please, Historia...

07:35.705 --> 07:36.581
Please...

07:38.708 --> 07:40.710
Please save me!

07:48.676 --> 07:50.511
I already told you, Ymir.

07:54.432 --> 07:55.600
No matter what happens,

07:56.309 --> 07:57.977
I will always be your ally!

08:39.185 --> 08:41.187
Reiner! Protect us!

08:54.367 --> 08:57.245
I knew it! I'll have to kill Ymir first!

08:58.621 --> 08:59.747
Wait, Mikasa!

09:03.125 --> 09:04.502
Don't kill Ymir!

09:04.919 --> 09:06.420
That all depends on her!

09:07.046 --> 09:07.964
What will it be?

09:08.130 --> 09:10.925
I'll kill everyone who gets in my way,
so choose!

09:11.217 --> 09:12.176
No, wait!

09:12.760 --> 09:15.638
Ymir will be killed unless
she does what Reiner and Bertholdt say!

09:16.013 --> 09:17.723
She doesn't have a choice!

09:19.517 --> 09:22.228
There are only so many lives
that I care about.

09:22.812 --> 09:26.274
Six years ago,
my enemies made the decision that easy.

09:27.149 --> 09:30.528
So you're wrong to seek any compassion
from me.

09:31.320 --> 09:33.239
Because right now, I'm all out of time

09:33.781 --> 09:36.158
and I don't have any room left
in my heart to care.

09:36.826 --> 09:39.745
Do you pick Eren or Ymir?

09:40.288 --> 09:41.205
Which is it?

09:41.956 --> 09:43.624
Will you get in my way, too?

09:45.209 --> 09:46.502
Stop, Ymir!

09:47.336 --> 09:49.255
Don't fight back! You'll die!

09:49.797 --> 09:50.840
Don't move!

10:01.183 --> 10:02.268
Quit it, Eren!

10:02.810 --> 10:03.894
Don't struggle!

10:04.770 --> 10:06.689
Good luck with that, Bertholdt.

10:07.398 --> 10:09.817
It's impossible to get him to calm down.

10:10.484 --> 10:12.820
He's the most irritating guy there is!

10:13.070 --> 10:14.405
I know better than anyone!

10:14.905 --> 10:17.033
I hate him as much as you do.

10:17.491 --> 10:19.118
So let's beat him up together.

10:20.328 --> 10:22.079
Why don't you come out of there?

10:22.371 --> 10:24.290
Give him back, Bertholdt!

10:24.415 --> 10:28.085
Hey, you're kidding, right?
Bertholdt? Reiner?

10:29.045 --> 10:30.379
This whole time,

10:30.796 --> 10:32.715
you've kept quiet and deceived us?

10:33.049 --> 10:34.842
That's so cruel!

10:35.051 --> 10:37.720
Tell us it's all a lie, you two!

10:42.308 --> 10:43.684
Hey...

10:44.018 --> 10:45.978
Do you think you can just
keep running away?

10:46.937 --> 10:48.689
That's not going to happen!

10:48.939 --> 10:50.149
For three years,

10:50.399 --> 10:53.903
didn't we sleep under one roof
as comrades through thick and thin?

10:54.236 --> 10:55.279
Your odd sleeping positions

10:55.988 --> 10:58.741
were truly an art form, Bertholdt...

10:59.450 --> 11:00.368
After a while,

11:00.701 --> 11:03.829
we all looked forward to seeing your pose
each morning

11:04.163 --> 11:06.040
and tried using it to predict the weather.

11:07.416 --> 11:08.751
But you...

11:09.543 --> 11:13.464
To think you,
the invader, could sleep like a log...

11:14.298 --> 11:16.008
right next to your victims!

11:16.717 --> 11:18.511
Was everything just a lie?

11:19.387 --> 11:22.223
Remember we talked about
surviving this together?

11:22.681 --> 11:23.974
And that we would grow old

11:24.100 --> 11:26.644
and someday go out for drinks together?

11:26.727 --> 11:29.522
Was everything... all a lie?

11:31.107 --> 11:32.108
Was it?

11:32.817 --> 11:33.651
You guys...

11:34.276 --> 11:36.946
What were you guys thinking
this whole time?

11:37.238 --> 11:39.031
What does it even matter anymore?

11:40.199 --> 11:42.827
Just focus on cutting his neck open.

11:43.661 --> 11:47.248
If you hesitate for a moment,
we won't be able to get Eren back.

11:47.957 --> 11:49.667
They are enemies of humanity.

11:50.167 --> 11:51.377
That's all there is to know.

11:53.712 --> 11:55.256
Tell me who!

11:55.589 --> 11:57.299
Who the hell would want to kill people

11:57.716 --> 11:59.051
by their own choice?

12:03.431 --> 12:05.850
Who the hell would like doing
this sort of thing?

12:06.934 --> 12:09.228
Do you think I wanted to do this?

12:10.354 --> 12:11.981
People hate and despise us...

12:12.440 --> 12:14.859
We've done such terrible things.
We deserve to die.

12:15.943 --> 12:17.987
Things we'll never be able to take back...

12:20.573 --> 12:21.407
But...

12:22.116 --> 12:24.994
we just couldn't come to terms
with our sins...

12:26.287 --> 12:28.205
The only time we had some peace

12:28.539 --> 12:30.833
was when we pretended to be soldiers.

12:31.959 --> 12:33.210
That's not a lie!

12:33.878 --> 12:35.212
Conny! Jean!

12:35.504 --> 12:38.841
It's true we may have deceived everyone,
but it's not all a lie!

12:39.467 --> 12:41.594
We really considered you our comrades!

12:43.762 --> 12:47.016
Neither of us has any right
to even apologize.

12:48.267 --> 12:50.269
But... someone...

12:51.061 --> 12:52.021
Please...

12:53.522 --> 12:54.940
Someone, please...

12:56.609 --> 12:58.027
Someone find us!

13:04.241 --> 13:05.451
Bertholdt...

13:06.660 --> 13:08.120
Give Eren back.

13:09.163 --> 13:11.290
It's no use... I can't.

13:12.833 --> 13:14.835
Someone has to be the one to do it.

13:15.878 --> 13:19.715
Someone has to be the one
to stain their hands with blood.

13:20.508 --> 13:21.550
You guys!

13:22.384 --> 13:24.220
Get away from there!

13:24.970 --> 13:26.347
Unbelievable...

13:26.847 --> 13:29.016
What the hell is that Erwin thinking?

13:30.351 --> 13:33.062
He's leading a horde of Titans this way!

13:48.160 --> 13:49.161
You guys!

13:49.328 --> 13:50.788
Jump and get out of there!

13:52.831 --> 13:53.958
All soldiers, disperse!

13:54.458 --> 13:56.043
Get far away from the Titans!

14:16.730 --> 14:17.982
Historia!

14:27.324 --> 14:28.325
What's going on?

14:29.493 --> 14:30.452
Is this hell?

14:32.705 --> 14:34.957
No, but it will be!

14:35.666 --> 14:37.167
All soldiers, charge!

14:39.169 --> 14:41.130
The fate of humanity will be determined

14:41.380 --> 14:43.340
at this very moment!

14:44.383 --> 14:48.095
There is no future
where humanity can inhabit these lands

14:48.262 --> 14:49.722
without Eren!

14:50.472 --> 14:53.225
We recover Eren and retreat immediately!

14:54.226 --> 14:56.854
Give your hearts!

14:58.647 --> 14:59.481
Mikasa!

15:07.698 --> 15:09.074
Those crazy Scouts.

15:10.034 --> 15:12.620
Something's wrong with their heads.

15:12.786 --> 15:14.246
-Hey!
-What?

15:20.502 --> 15:22.087
What's happening out there?

15:22.630 --> 15:24.006
What the hell's going on?

15:28.302 --> 15:29.345
I can't move...

15:30.012 --> 15:31.513
Unless I tear these Titans off me,

15:32.348 --> 15:34.808
it will only get worse.

15:35.392 --> 15:36.435
In that case...

15:37.102 --> 15:39.772
Brace yourself, Bertholdt!

15:41.023 --> 15:42.191
A little more...

15:42.900 --> 15:44.401
Just a little more!

15:45.277 --> 15:46.153
It worked!

15:46.820 --> 15:47.863
His hands are gone!

15:48.364 --> 15:49.323
Now's our chance!

15:49.490 --> 15:52.451
Hey, Mikasa?
Can't you see all those Titans?

15:52.868 --> 15:55.996
How do you plan on
getting through that mess?

15:56.747 --> 15:58.791
You would have to slip through
a horde of them.

15:59.249 --> 16:00.626
Advance!

16:07.257 --> 16:10.052
Commander Erwin!

16:11.261 --> 16:14.181
Advance!

16:15.140 --> 16:16.892
Eren is just ahead!

16:17.351 --> 16:19.103
Advance!

16:21.188 --> 16:22.022
Right!

16:59.768 --> 17:00.894
Mikasa!

17:02.104 --> 17:03.647
You piece of shit!

17:03.856 --> 17:05.816
Let her go!

17:13.157 --> 17:14.992
We've come this far already.

17:15.492 --> 17:17.202
We're taking Eren home with us.

17:17.536 --> 17:19.163
We're going back to our hometown.

17:19.830 --> 17:22.583
Shit... This is all because I got caught.

17:23.083 --> 17:25.169
Everyone's going to die because of me.

17:25.461 --> 17:26.545
Bertholdt!

17:29.298 --> 17:30.215
Armin?

17:33.635 --> 17:35.637
Those who can't abandon anything...

17:36.388 --> 17:38.432
can't change anything.

17:39.308 --> 17:41.185
Advance!

17:43.145 --> 17:44.271
What is it?

17:44.938 --> 17:46.523
What do I have to abandon?

17:47.357 --> 17:48.817
Is it my life?

17:50.611 --> 17:51.862
Or something else?

18:11.340 --> 18:13.509
Are you two okay with this?

18:14.802 --> 18:18.013
Leaving behind your comrades
and returning home?

18:22.017 --> 18:23.644
Are you abandoning Annie?

18:24.728 --> 18:28.732
Right now, she's far north,
deep underground in the Utopia District...

18:29.274 --> 18:30.776
and being tortured.

18:33.362 --> 18:35.614
It was her screams
that taught us something.

18:36.323 --> 18:38.033
That even with her body's healing,

18:38.450 --> 18:41.161
you can never get rid of the pain.

18:43.330 --> 18:46.542
They're taking special care
to ensure she doesn't die.

18:47.292 --> 18:48.710
And as we speak,

18:49.336 --> 18:51.755
they're not giving her any rest.

18:52.631 --> 18:56.301
They're torturing her in every way
they know how.

18:57.678 --> 18:59.346
You spawn of the devil!

18:59.555 --> 19:01.265
I'll pulverize you!

19:21.702 --> 19:23.954
All soldiers, retreat!

19:38.844 --> 19:39.928
I did it.

19:41.054 --> 19:42.347
My first kill.

19:42.973 --> 19:44.725
-Ymir...
-Christa!

19:47.769 --> 19:50.189
What the hell are you doing?
We're leaving!

19:50.314 --> 19:52.524
Let's hurry home and chow down!

19:52.774 --> 19:54.943
Conny! Sasha! Leave me be!

19:55.319 --> 19:56.820
-Let me go!
-What?

19:57.446 --> 19:59.531
Ymir said if I don't go with her,

19:59.823 --> 20:01.867
Reiner and Bertholdt
are going to kill her!

20:02.242 --> 20:04.703
If she hands me in,
they'll let her go free!

20:05.287 --> 20:07.497
We were going to go with them!

20:09.750 --> 20:11.919
What the heck? Ymir said that?

20:12.169 --> 20:13.879
Yes, so let me down!

20:14.671 --> 20:17.174
It's a lie! Of course, that's a lie!

20:17.424 --> 20:18.550
She's lying to you!

20:19.885 --> 20:21.178
Sasha is right.

20:21.678 --> 20:24.223
Do you think the one who fought
like a maniac to save you

20:24.306 --> 20:26.266
would do something like that?

20:30.062 --> 20:33.398
The only time Ymir ever shows some effort
is when you're in trouble.

20:34.274 --> 20:36.860
I don't know about her getting killed,
but...

20:37.736 --> 20:39.529
For now, just calm down.

20:39.738 --> 20:40.822
That's right!

20:40.989 --> 20:42.658
If you two stay here any longer,

20:42.991 --> 20:44.660
there's a huge chance that you'll die

20:44.826 --> 20:46.078
and things will only get worse!

20:48.247 --> 20:51.625
You know,
even an idiot could figure that out.

21:06.306 --> 21:07.391
Damn that Reiner!

21:07.724 --> 21:09.810
He's tossing the Titans like a madman!

21:22.364 --> 21:23.865
Eren! Mikasa!

21:28.870 --> 21:29.746
Eren...

23:33.703 --> 23:36.790
Eren encounters the very Titan
that devoured his mother.

23:37.749 --> 23:41.211
Unable to move his body,
Hannes steps in to protect him.

23:42.212 --> 23:43.672
What is the enemy?

23:44.089 --> 23:45.590
What is war?

23:46.550 --> 23:49.177
Not knowing what to brandish
their swords against, 

23:49.427 --> 23:51.471
the Scouts fight on.

23:52.848 --> 23:56.685
Where will they ever find the future
that they pursue?

23:57.894 --> 24:00.939
Next episode, "Scream."
